PARITY SUMMARY
  The web page lets an operator pick a vehicle + window + bucket and inspect, live, how many telemetry
  samples arrived (total + per-field) over the window. The native port reproduces the four GlassPanels:
    GlassPanel1  controls  → IngestXRayControlsPanel  (vehicle/window/bucket pickers over the shared TSSelect;
                             the bucket list is pruned by the web "bucket >= window" guard, web XRayControls.tsx)
    GlassPanel2  no-vehicle → IngestXRayNoVehiclePanel (TSEmptyState; web `vehicleId === null` branch)
    GlassPanel3  chart     → IngestXRayBucketChartPanel (Swift Charts bar series via the P3 TSBarChart wrapper —
                             NO raw `Charts` import — with loading/empty/content + CSV export; web XRayBucketChart.tsx)
    GlassPanel4  fields    → IngestXRayFieldsPanel (wraps the shipped XRayFieldsTable surface; web XRayFieldsTable.tsx)
  plus the summary header strip (the shipped XRayHeader surface) between the controls and the chart, exactly as the
  web page renders it after a vehicle is selected. The page is the single data owner (IngestXRayPageModel, @Observable
  @MainActor, P1/S8) and relays the header + fields slices to the two shipped child models through their in-memory
  sources — DRY reuse of the already-merged P5/P6 surfaces, not a re-implementation.

STATES (every state renders — none hidden behind a null guard)
  loading  → XRayPhase.loading: chart TSChartSkeleton + XRayHeader skeleton tiles + XRayFieldsTable TSTableSkeleton
  empty    → XRayPhase.empty (zero samples) chart empty note + XRayFieldsTable empty; AND the idle "select a vehicle"
             panel (GlassPanel2) — the web `vehicleId === null` empty selection state
  success  → XRayPhase.content: chart bars + header value tiles + sortable field table
  error    → child error states (XRayHeader/XRayFieldsTable QueryError + Retry) + chart empty note
  stale/offline → IngestXRayStalenessBanner over the cached counts (ADR-013 >2-min staleness), auto-refresh on stale

